---
source: crates/runtime/tests/models/search.rs
description: "SELECT id, answer FROM text_search(qs, 'second') order by _score desc LIMIT 4"
---
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| plan_type     | plan                                                                                                                                                                                                           |
+---------------+----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------+
| logical_plan  | Projection: text_search(qs, Utf8("second")).id, text_search(qs, Utf8("second")).answer                                                                                                                         |
|               |   Sort: text_search(qs, Utf8("second"))._score DESC NULLS FIRST, fetch=4                                                                                                                                       |
|               |     Projection: text_search(qs, Utf8("second")).id, text_search(qs, Utf8("second")).answer, text_search(qs, Utf8("second"))._score                                                                             |
|               |       SearchTelemetry                                                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |         SubqueryAlias: text_search(qs, Utf8("second"))                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |           Projection: search_index._score, base_table.answer, search_index.id, base_table.question, base_table.reference_answer, base_table.source, base_table.subject                                         |
|               |             Sort: search_index._score DESC NULLS FIRST                                                                                                                                                         |
|               |               Projection: search_index.id, search_index._score, base_table.answer, base_table.question, base_table.reference_answer, base_table.source, base_table.subject                                     |
|               |                 Left Join: search_index.id = base_table.id                                                                                                                                                     |
|               |                   SubqueryAlias: search_index                                                                                                                                                                  |
|               |                     SubqueryAlias: search_index                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |                       TableScan: full_text                                                                                                                                                                     |
