|               |                     TableScan: base_table projection=[answer, id, question, reference_answer, source, subject]                                                                                                 |
| physical_plan | ProjectionExec: expr=[id@0 as id, answer@1 as answer]                                                                                                                                                          |
|               |   SortPreservingMergeExec: [_score@2 DESC], fetch=4                                                                                                                                                            |
|               |     SortExec: TopK(fetch=4), expr=[_score@2 DESC], preserve_partitioning=[true]                                                                                                                                |
|               |       ProjectionExec: expr=[id@2 as id, answer@1 as answer, _score@0 as _score]                                                                                                                                |
|               |         SearchTelemetryExec                                                                                                                                                                                    |
|               |           RepartitionExec: partitioning=RoundRobinBatch(3), input_partitions=1                                                                                                                                 |
|               |             ProjectionExec: expr=[_score@1 as _score, answer@2 as answer, id@0 as id, question@3 as question, reference_answer@4 as reference_answer, source@5 as source, subject@6 as subject]                |
|               |               HashJoinExec: mode=CollectLeft, join_type=Left, accumulator=MinMaxLeftAccumulator, on=[(id@0, id@1)], projection=[id@0, _score@1, answer@2, question@4, reference_answer@5, source@6, subject@7] |
|               |                 CooperativeExec                                                                                                                                                                                |
|               |                   BytesProcessedExec                                                                                                                                                                           |
